{"word":"ἔνορκος","uri":"enorkos","senses":[{"word":"ἔνορκος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἔν·ορκος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ος, ον,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">litt.</span> engagé par un serment :\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> <span class=\"ital\">en\nparl. de pers.</span> lié par un serment : <span class=\"grec\">τινι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"refch\">72,</span> envers qqn ;\n<span class=\"grec\">ἔνορκόν τινα λαμϐάνειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschn.</span> <span class=\"refch\">66, 29 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">θέσθαι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"refch\">811 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ποιεῖν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">6, 49, 2,</span> lier qqn par un serment\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">en\nparl. de choses,</span> confirmé par un serment, <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ant.</span> <span class=\"refch\">369 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">843</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἔνορκόν τι λαμϐάνειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">773, 5,</span> recevoir une promesse faite avec\nserment ; <span class=\"grec\">ἔνορκόν ἐστί τινι,</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec l’inf.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Hell.</span> <span class=\"refch\">6, 3,\n18,</span> on s’engage par serment à, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἔνορκον ποιεῖσθαι,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">avec</span> <span class=\"grec\">μή</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">et l’inf. fut.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Phæd.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">89</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, s’enga